252
00:18:17,660 --> 00:18:18,780
Give me the snail.

253
00:18:21,420 --> 00:18:23,197
We are waiting at sea.

254
00:18:23,280 --> 00:18:24,157
Right outside.

255
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:25,737
