A ceremony.

538
00:39:48,040 --> 00:39:49,320
Sergeant Tommy.

539
00:39:57,740 --> 00:39:58,940
Hey.

540
00:40:00,880 --> 00:40:03,577
Mother, would you like a bite?

541
00:40:03,660 --> 00:40:06,477
A flavor that's covered in light.

542
00:40:06,560 --> 00:40:09,220
I feel it in my soul shining bright.

543
00:40:14,340 --> 00:40:18,120
Of course, it's just like that day.

544
00:40:19,340 --> 00:40:22,960
The flavor of joy, you might say.

545
00:40:25,200 --> 00:40:28,480
Happy birthday, Lin-Lin, eat up.

546
00:40:31,660 --> 00:40:35,537
Maybe someday, not so far away.

547
00:40:35,620 --> 00:40:38,840
Let's eat together, okay.

548
00:40:39,400 --> 00:40:43,497
Laugh this and be, sweet as can be.

549
00:40:43,580 --> 00:40:46,840
And just a touch.

550
00:40:51,980 --> 00:40:53,100
Risky.

551
00:41:08,420 --> 00:41:11,800
Hey, Martha, can I pull this off?

552
00:41:12,180 --> 00:41:13,780
My dream, I mean.

553
00:41:16,360 --> 00:41:19,900
Everyone is happy here.

554
00:41:20,240 --> 00:41:23,980
Peaceful days without a fear.

555
00:41:24,340 --> 00:41:27,497
Every race is welcome too.

556
00:41:27,580 --> 00:41:30,820
Let your dreams come true.

557
00:41:32,580 --> 00:41:36,800
But if you try to leave,
I'll run you right through.

558
00:41:39,200 --> 00:41:43,557
Feel free to sign your soul away.

559
00:41:43,640 --> 00:41:46,800
The prize for a peaceful day.

560
00:41:47,580 --> 00:41:51,337
Here we're all a family.

561
00:41:51,420 --> 00:41:55,420
But don't defy her majesty!

562
00:41:57,580 --> 00:41:58,740
BIT MORE!

563
00:42:06,580 --> 00:42:07,740
Ha-ha-ha-ha!

564
00:42:08,440 --> 00:42:10,140
Ma-ma-ma-ma-ma!

565
00:42:12,580 --> 00:42:14,080
It was just delish!

566
00:42:14,680 --> 00:42:17,860
What a great meal!
